			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@westbrook\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>westbrook</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I personally like the new approach. It makes it super readable even for less technical people in a team, e.g. designers who do accessibility QA.</p>",
