			},
			"date": "2025-01-05T21:00:52.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@mariohamann\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>mariohamann</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Simple patterns, almost:</p><p>- heading \"Heading text\" [level=1]</p><p>VS</p><p>{<br>  role: 'heading',<br>  name: \"Heading text\"<br>  level: 1<br>}</p><p>More complex patterns, dropping data?</p><p>- combobox \"Combobox\" [expanded]<br>- listbox \"Combobox\":<br>  - children[]</p><p>VS</p><p>{<br>  role: 'combobox',<br>  name: 'Combobox',<br>  expanded: true,<br>  focused: true,<br>  haspopup: 'listbox'<br>},<br>{<br>  role: 'listbox',<br>  name: 'Combobox',<br>  orientation: 'vertical',<br>  children: []<br>}</p><p>Better that the new API is not deprecated, however.</p>",
